  <!-- EN: ballistae -->
  <VR_Construct_Ballistae.label>弩炮</VR_Construct_Ballistae.label>
  <!-- EN: A clunky multi-legged combat construct specialized as a long-range weapons platform. While effective at distance, it is weak in close-range fights and in melee combat. -->
  <VR_Construct_Ballistae.description>一种笨重的多足战斗构装体，专门作为远程武器平台。远距离有效，但在近距离和近战中很弱。</VR_Construct_Ballistae.description>
  <!-- EN: construct ballista -->
  <VR_Construct_Ballistae.comps.Comp_VerbProps.verbProps.0.label>构装弩炮</VR_Construct_Ballistae.comps.Comp_VerbProps.verbProps.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Shoots target with steam powered ballista -->
  <VR_Construct_Ballistae.comps.Comp_VerbProps.verbProps.0.description>使用蒸汽动力弩炮射击目标。</VR_Construct_Ballistae.comps.Comp_VerbProps.verbProps.0.description>
